.TH SDSSD 8 "May 2026" "sdss 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
sdssd \- Steam / Discord status scheduler session daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sdssd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sdssd
is the always-on user-session daemon for Steam / Discord Status Scheduler (SDSS).
It owns configuration, scheduler state, the Discord token in the system keyring,
and the D-Bus service
.BR org.steamdiscord.Scheduler .
.PP
Clients (\fBsdss\fR CLI, \fBsdss-tray\fR, \fBsdss-settings\fR) talk to the daemon
over the session bus; they do not write \fIconfig.toml\fR or keyring entries directly.
.SH D-BUS INTERFACE
Object path \fB/org/steamdiscord/Scheduler1\fR, interface
.BR org.steamdiscord.Scheduler1 .
.PP
Methods include \fBStatus\fR, \fBGetConfigToml\fR, \fBSetConfigToml\fR, \fBHasToken\fR,
\fBListSubdivisions\fR, \fBListHolidayBundles\fR, \fBApplyNow\fR, \fBSetOverride\fR,
\fBClearOverride\fR, \fBMigrateLegacy\fR, and \fBQuit\fR.
Properties: \fBWorkMode\fR, \fBSource\fR, \fBNextWake\fR.
Signals: \fBStatusChanged\fR, \fBConfigChanged\fR.
.SH SYSTEMD
Install the user unit \fBsdssd.service\fR and enable it with
\fBsystemctl --user enable --now sdssd\fR.
The unit uses \fBType=notify\fR and memory limits (\fBMemoryHigh=20M\fR, \fBMemoryMax=40M\fR).
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/sdss/config.toml\fR
Main configuration (daemon is the writer).
.TP
\fI$XDG_STATE_HOME/sdss/state.json\fR
Override and last-apply state.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sdss (1),
.BR sdss-tray (1),
.BR sdss-settings (1)
